# The root .html files and sitemap.xml are written by tools/build.py.
# Collapse them in review by default; the sources are what to read.
#
# Both patterns are anchored with a leading slash. Without it, *.html
# matches at every depth and would collapse src/pages/ and src/partials/
# too — the exact files this comment says to read.
/*.html linguist-generated=true
/sitemap.xml linguist-generated=true
